on-arrival: agricultural_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and agricultural_policy_timer == 0
card-image: img/placeholder.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: The land question - latifundios, braceros, and the IRA.

= Agrarian Reform

The agrarian question is the central social problem of the Republic. In Andalusia and Extremadura, vast estates (*latifundios*) sit alongside a mass of landless day-laborers (*braceros*) living in desperate poverty. The Republican-Socialist coalition has committed to land reform through the new Instituto de Reforma Agraria (IRA), but our coalition partners in the Agriculture Ministry are more cautious than we are, and every step is contested.

- @land_reform
- @agricultural_finance
- @pro_consumer
- @state_buyer
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@land_reform
title: Expropriate the Latifundios
subtitle: -1 budget - Expropriate the great estates through the IRA and settle braceros on the land.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2 and budget > 0
on-arrival: budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; rural_policy += 1; coalition_dissent += 1; landless_psoe += 7*(1-dissent); landless_ceda -= 4*(1-dissent); landless_other -= 2*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; radical_relation -= 5; ceda_relation -= 4; left_strength += 8; left_dissent -= 5; coup_progress += 1; agriculture_goal_completed += 1; agriculture_goal_psoe_peoples += 1; president_angry += 10
max-visits: 4

Through the IRA, we expropriate farmland from the great estates - with compensation, under the *bases de asentamiento* - and settle it with braceros' associations and smallholders. In essence, this brings class struggle to the countryside, breaking the semi-feudal property relations of Andalusia and Extremadura. The <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CEDA**</span> and the great landowners despise our intrusion into the sacredness of private property, while the Caballerista left is cautiously optimistic that it does not go further.

[? if president == "Alcalá-Zamora" : This policy has especially earned us the ire of President Alcalá-Zamora and the conservative establishment. ?]

@agricultural_finance
title: Rural Credit
subtitle: -1 budget - Increase financing for agricultural credit and insurance.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; rural_policy += 1; landless_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); landless_ceda -= 3*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1; center_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 4; agriculture_goal_psoe_peoples += 1; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased financial support for smallholders, providing access to credit and insurance, saving them from privation. The Caballerista left and Besteiristas of our party are wary of our rural policy, seeing these measures as giveaways to the smallholding peasantry rather than the landless braceros who need it most.


@pro_consumer
title: Food Procurement
subtitle: -1 budget - Provide inexpensive food for workers.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if black_thursday_seen; agriculture_goal_psoe += 1; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased state purchasing of food staples to provide to urban workers and the poor. This benefits industrial workers more than it benefits smallholders, as we are negotiating for lower purchase prices. [? if black_thursday_seen and in_republican_socialist : Our coalition partners consider this policy to be a wasteful handout. ?]

@state_buyer
title: State Grain Monopoly
subtitle: -2 budget - Create a state monopoly for grain purchases, guaranteeing prices for smallholders and stable prices for consumers. [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: budget >= 2 and judicial_reform >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; landless_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); landless_ceda -= 3*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if in_republican_socialist; radical_relation -= 5; ceda_relation -= 3; peoples_party_support += 1; rural_policy += 2; capital_strike_progress += 1; izq_rep_relation -= 3; agriculture_goal_psoe += 1; president_angry += 5; economic_growth += 0.4;
max-visits: 1

Our new purchasing agency guarantees fair prices for smallholders, while also providing lower food prices for workers and the urban poor. This policy necessitates heavy spending and an unprecedented level of state intervention in the economy, raising the ire of conservative economists and the landowning oligarchy.

[? if president == "Alcalá-Zamora" : This policy has earned us the ire of President Alcalá-Zamora and the conservative establishment. ?]
